Wayland protocol descriptions used by the Wayland backend of walpe-daemon.

meson turns each <name>.xml into <name>-client-protocol.h and <name>-protocol.c
with wayland-scanner (meson.build, wl_protocol_names). The files are unchanged
copies; each one carries its own copyright and licence notice (MIT-style
"permission to use, copy, modify, distribute" terms), which apply to that file
and not to the rest of this tree. The notices are collected in
licenses/Wayland-protocols.txt, which is installed with the programs.

